We perform weekly vehicle compliance checks, during which we verify the license plate numbers of all vehicles on the platform against a public database. Based on this, we block vehicles that are not found in the database (this part works as intended) and, conversely, unblock vehicles that have reappeared in the database. Each week, this may involve unblocking around 300 car IDs. The *document_upload_requested* block type is used exclusively for this compliance check, so there should always be only one active block of this type per vehicle.
{quote}

